msgctxt "77\t160"
msgid "It's been a while, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164\t235"
msgid "What are you doing down here?"
msgstr "Che ci fai qui?"

msgctxt "245\t384"
msgid ""
"Looking into a family matter regarding\\nthe land for the Okinawa resort "
"deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "385\t468"
msgid "You're involved in this resort business?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "471\t499"
msgid "In a way."
msgstr "In un certo senso."

msgctxt "501\t670"
msgid ""
"To be more specific, the ones responsible\\nfor the situation I'm confronted"
" with..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "683\t830"
msgid "Are a small Okinawa-based offshoot of the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832\t884"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "886\t1044"
msgid "That piece of the Tojo you're talkin' about...\\nIs it the Tamashiro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1049\t1091"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "1094\t1247"
msgid ""
"The Tamashiro Family was originally founded\\nto give us a foothold on the "
"island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1254\t1514"
msgid ""
"But now they've gone behind our backs and started\\nbuying up the land here "
"for use in the resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1529\t1657"
msgid "What do the Tamashiro stand to gain from that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1677\t1737"
msgid "As it turns out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1741\t1963"
msgid ""
"Minister Suzuki, of the resort program, asked them to\\nscoop up every patch"
" of crucial real estate in his stead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2003\t2203"
msgid ""
"After all, his plan can't move forward without\\na certain amount of land to"
" build on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2214\t2310"
msgid "So that's what they're up to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2317\t2583"
msgid ""
"Yes. In order to get the land he required,\\nSuzuki-san needed a local "
"organization on his side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2600\t2720"
msgid "And the Tamashiro Family just so\\nhappened to fit the bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2737\t2966"
msgid "I see. But that doesn't explain\\nwhy you came here yourself, Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3005\t3156"
msgid ""
"It seems the Tamashiro are using some\\nquestionable methods to get a hold "
"of the land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3186\t3325"
msgid ""
"In some cases, they've even resorted to\\nstealing the deeds from their "
"rightful owners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3342\t3502"
msgid ""
"Is that why they abducted my Saki?\\nTo trade her for some scrap of paper?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3509\t3573"
msgid "Most likely, yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3576\t3820"
msgid ""
"They knew how much you cared for the girl,\\nand intended to use that "
"affection against you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3831\t4011"
msgid "Those Tamashiro assholes...\\nNot a shred of humanity, the lot of 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4026\t4208"
msgid ""
"Allowing them to keep employing\\nthose tactics would only lead to trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4237\t4390"
msgid ""
"Imagine the scandal if the public knew\\nyakuza were involved in the resort "
"deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4395\t4568"
msgid ""
"Both it and the proposed military expansion\\nwould find themselves at "
"extreme risk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4603\t4751"
msgid ""
"Tamiya-san from the Ministry of Defense\\npersonally requested that I "
"intervene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4766\t4826"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "Interessante."

msgctxt "4844\t5068"
msgid ""
"The truth of it is, the resort deal and\\nthe proposed military base are a "
"linked pair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5082\t5139"
msgid "Meaning what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5148\t5393"
msgid "You can't have one without the other.\\nIf one fails, both fail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5423\t5564"
msgid ""
"Were the resort to be canceled, for example,\\nonly the base would remain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5566\t5675"
msgid "But public opinion would never\\nsupport it on its own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5695\t5910"
msgid ""
"In that sense, the resort's success is just as vital\\nto Tamiya-san as that"
" of his own bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5937\t5997"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "6009\t6320"
msgid ""
"And that's why Tamiya sent you down here.\\nHe needs you to keep things from"
" boiling over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6322\t6390"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "6401\t6595"
msgid ""
"This particular visit was requested by Toma-kun here.\\nHe asked that I "
"accompany Tamiya-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6612\t6790"
msgid "I'm Minister Tamiya's personal secretary,\\nShoyo Toma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6802\t7016"
msgid ""
"Kid like you workin' for the Minister of Defense?\\nThat's some impressive "
"shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7018\t7190"
msgid "Not at all. I'm merely tasked with\\ncarrying out the Minister's orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7203\t7450"
msgid ""
"Hold on. If you stop the Tamashiro from buying\\nthe land, they'd have "
"nowhere to build the resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7470\t7650"
msgid "Not to mention Tamiya's military base."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7666\t7845"
msgid ""
"Indeed. We hope to attain the land through\\nnegotiation with the locals, "
"not threats."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7861\t7980"
msgid "Why do all this for just one bill?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8001\t8121"
msgid ""
"This base would be a major international success,\\nfar outweighing some "
"trivial little resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8123\t8280"
msgid "A triumph befitting of the next prime minister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8304\t8383"
msgid "So it's all politics."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8389\t8575"
msgid ""
"As for the Tojo Clan, we usually stay out\\nof the business of our families."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8590\t8785"
msgid ""
"But were this to become a scandal,\\nit would attract unwanted police "
"attention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8797\t8978"
msgid "We absolutely can't allow that to happen.\\nHence why I'm here now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8995\t9080"
msgid "So that's what's going on."
msgstr "Ah, allora è così che stanno le cose."

msgctxt "9105\t9400"
msgid ""
"But I had no idea your orphanage was being\\nthreatened, Kiryu-san. It came "
"as quite a shock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9429\t9654"
msgid ""
"Guess that means you're not gonna have to\\npart with your land. That's a "
"win in my book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9657\t9715"
msgid "I suppose."
msgstr "Immagino."

msgctxt "9732\t9925"
msgid "That may be true for the moment,\\nbut your time is not infinite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9953\t10127"
msgid ""
"I will do whatever it takes to ensure\\nthis resort deal meets with success."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10139\t10264"
msgid "Whaddya mean?\\nI thought you were in Tamiya's corner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10268\t10385"
msgid "Shouldn't you be worrying about the base?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10408\t10653"
msgid ""
"I'm an Okinawa native, myself... so it pains me\\nto see my beloved home "
"slowly fade into obscurity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10668\t10945"
msgid ""
"If we fail to bring in the resources this resort\\npromises, our island will"
" die a prolonged, agonizing death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10988\t11235"
msgid ""
"I may work under Minister Tamiya, yes,\\nbut I'll do what I must to support "
"my people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11308\t11392"
msgid "Toma-san, was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11400\t11442"
msgid "That's correct."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11446\t11706"
msgid ""
"If you're really a local, you should know\\npeople don't want your damn "
"resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11773\t11880"
msgid ""
"I used to think it wouldn't be so bad\\nif it was bringing in the cash..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11884\t11990"
msgid "But I was dead wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11994\t12192"
msgid ""
"What people here really care about is keepin'\\nthe Okinawa they love just "
"the way it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12230\t12495"
msgid ""
"As if that matters in Tokyo. To them we're\\nnothing more than an "
"insignificant speck of earth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12553\t12796"
msgid ""
"But I'll do whatever it takes to change that.\\nEven if it means making "
"sacrifices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12814\t12928"
msgid "Sacrifices like our land, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12948\t13112"
msgid "Correct. Okinawa is famous for its abundant beaches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13123\t13288"
msgid ""
"There should be no harm in laying claim\\nto a few acres of that abundance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13299\t13533"
msgid "So the ends justify the means, huh?\\nSpoken like a true politician."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13536\t13701"
msgid "But y'know... People might not be\\nas willing to budge as you hope."
msgstr ""
